      "text": "145,  205.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of **255** and **573**, we'll follow a step-by-step multiplication process:\n\n### Step 1: Multiply 255 by the Ones Place Digit of 573\n\\[\n255 \\times 3 = 765\n\\]\n\n### Step 2: Multiply 255 by the Tens Place Digit of 573\n\\[\n255 \\times 70 = 17,\\!850\n\\]\n\n### Step 3: Multiply 255 by the Hundreds Place Digit of 573\n\\[\n255 \\times 500 = 127,\\!500\n\\]\n\n### Step 4: Sum All the Results\n\\[\n765 + 17,\\!850 + 127,\\!500 = 145,\\!205\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer:\n\\[\n\\boxed{145,\\!205}\n\\]",
